<h2 id="add-your-dataset">Add your dataset</h2>

<p>See the <a href="/data/create/">how to</a> if you want to create your own fiboa-compliant dataset.</p>

<p>Once your dataset is ready, you have two options to add your dataset:</p>

<ol>
  <li>If it has a STAC Collection for it, edit <a href="https://github.com/fiboa/fiboa.github.io/edit/main/stac/catalog.json">this file</a>, add your Collection as a child to the STAC catalog, and lastly create a PR.</li>
  <li>In all other cases, edit <a href="https://github.com/fiboa/fiboa.github.io/edit/main/data/external.yaml">this file</a>, add your dataset to the list of external datasets, and lastly create a PR.</li>
</ol>

<p>Once the PR is merged your data will be listed here shortly after (it’s updated at least every night).</p>
